<title>FINLAND: TAMFELT JAN-APRIL PROFIT RISES 38 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>TAMFELT JAN-APRIL PROFIT RISES 38 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April, 1997</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	   47.9 vs 34.7</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   5.10 vs 3.75</p>
<p> Net sales					  195.6 vs 174.3</p>
<p> Operating profit				  40.8 vs 27.7</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of five analysts' forecasts for Finnish</p>
<p>paper manufacturing equipment supplier Tamfelt Oy profit before</p>
<p>extras, tax had been 31 million markka (range 29-37 mln markka).</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	50.9 vs 37.9</p>
<p> Depreciation					10.1 vs 10.2</p>
<p> Net financial items			 gain 7.1 vs 7.0 gain</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	 47.9 vs 34.7</p>
<p> Taxes						 14.2 vs 10.0</p>
<p> Net profit					  33,7 vs 24.7</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    76.4 vs 64.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Tamfelt Oy Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 6805 0245</p>
</text>
